{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TH","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"帖撒羅尼迦後書","commonName":"帖撒羅尼迦後書","title":"帖撒羅尼迦後書","order":53,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"217033e5cef30535fdb438b469c96b7e48f23861a1c526c2cfb6c342ff8f94c0","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2TH/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":47},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["請求代禱"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄姊妹，最後我還要請你們為我們禱告，好使主的道像在你們那裡一樣迅速傳開、受到尊崇，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["並使我們能避開那些邪惡的人，因為不是人人都有信心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["主是信實的，祂必使你們剛強，保護你們脫離那惡者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我們靠著主深信你們正遵行我們的吩咐，而且以後還會繼續遵行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["願主引導你們的心領悟上帝的愛和基督的堅忍。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["不可遊手好閒"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["弟兄姊妹，現在我們奉主耶穌基督的名吩咐你們，要遠離那些遊手好閒、不遵守我們教導的信徒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你們自己知道應該怎樣效法我們，因為我們在你們那裡的時候，並沒有懶懶散散，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["也沒有白吃誰的飯，而是晝夜辛勤工作，免得成為你們任何人的負擔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這並不是因為我們沒有權利接受供應，而是要給你們樹立學習的榜樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我們在你們那裡的時候，曾吩咐過你們：不肯工作的人沒有資格吃飯。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我們聽說在你們當中有些人遊手好閒，無所事事，專管閒事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我們奉主耶穌基督的名吩咐並勸誡這些人要安分守己，自食其力。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["弟兄姊妹，你們要堅持行善，不要灰心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["如果有人不聽從這信上的教導，要注意提防他，不要和他來往，好使他羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["只是不可把他當作仇人，要像對待弟兄姊妹一樣勸誡他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["問候"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["願平安之主隨時隨地親自賜你們平安！願主與你們同在！"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["我保羅在這裡親筆問候你們，這是我的筆跡，我所有的信都以此為記號。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["願我們主耶穌基督的恩典與你們眾人同在！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2TH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2TH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}